      "scrnout_description": "SN: Baltimore City Screened Out same referral on 1/9/21 (i202100615205) The EH worker called 911 and Officer Johnson, K283, Eastern District, 443 938-2569, responded to the call. Officer Johnson went to the address given by the caller, 806 Webb St. Baltimore, MD, 21202, and the Officer reported that the mother and child did not live at that address. The EH worker gave the Officer another address, 835 McKim St. Baltimore, MD, 21202, and the mother and child were at that address. The Officer reported that the child had 3 dark marks on his head and one on his nose. The Officer reported that the marks did not look like bruises, but just dark areas on the child''s face and nose. The Officer spoke to the mother and the mother reported that the child had seizures and the marks have been on his head and nose for a while. The Officer stated that the mother showed him a picture taken in September 2020, with the same marks on the child. The Officer gave the EH worker a CC# 3210102295 for unfounded child abuse.",
